<title>USA: Detroit &amp; Canada Tunnel sale completed.</title>
<headline>Detroit &amp; Canada Tunnel sale completed.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Detroit &amp; Canada Tunnel Corp. said Monday its $36.5 million acquisition by Hyde Park Holdings Inc and a major insurance and investment company has been completed.</p>
<p>Detroit &amp; Canada Tunnel shareholders will receive $54 a share in cash for company's the 676,027 shares outstanding. The company operates the toll tunnel that connects Detroit to Windsor, Ontario.</p>
</text>
